{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_05_end",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_05",
  "title": "各抒己見",
  "storyCode": "GT-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1964ebdcfd591fa26fd41afaee036a758ecad5569711f6710e0bc53b08ecc12a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "呃......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "你，你這個礙事的混蛋小子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "都、都頭破血流成這樣了，還敢在這擋我們的好事——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "區區這點傷，連日常訓練都算不上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "咕——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "還剩多少人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "算了，記不清了，反正已經全都擋住——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "發、發生地震了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "欸？那邊的山岩怎麼崩塌了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "騙人的吧？她居然打破了那麼厚的石壁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "入口被打開了一條新的路！趕緊進去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "糟了，那些人一定會從斯卡蒂打出的通道湧進來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "得趕快去幫可——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "站住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "斯卡蒂——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "居然能直接破壞山體，強行穿過去，羅德島的異聞果然是真的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "那個女孩在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "我不能告訴你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "盯上那東西的人不止我一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "難道我非要把你好好教訓一頓，你才不會礙事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你突然就要帶走可蘿爾，我怎麼也不能輕易把她交給你啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你要......阻礙羅德島的任務？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你也沒告訴我羅德島給你分配了什麼任務啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "除非你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "不要突然攻擊同伴啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "誰是你的同伴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我最後一次問，帶我去見那個女孩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "只要她還是我的委託人，我就絕不會這麼做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "嗚呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "可惡，她只是用劍隨手碰了下我的槍而已啊，可我的胳膊好像要斷了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "只憑你這種能力，你真的認為自己保護得了她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "能不能做到，和去不去做是兩回事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "嗯？先等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "嘁，這下總該打中了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的賞金獵人",
      "text": "好像有，不對，好像沒有！那傢伙還好好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......又來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "呃......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的賞金獵人",
      "text": "災、災星！把上尉打傷的，就是你吧！你今天就別想從這裡——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "好機會，趁現在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "你也別想過去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你們還是想想辦法先攔住她吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "——咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "什麼情況？！那個小個子，從我們頭上跳過去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "斯卡蒂，我先走一步了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "不好意思！等你想清楚，準備告訴我事實了，我再考慮可蘿爾的事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "站住，你去哪裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "抱歉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的賞金獵人",
      "text": "你怎麼就放她走了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "她跑得太快了，我們追不上她啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的賞金獵人",
      "text": "沒事，這不是還有一個嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗暴的賞金獵人",
      "text": "你個子那麼大，不可能也跳過去吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你們完蛋了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "岔路好多啊。這裡就是可蘿爾所說的墓穴了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "呃，賞金獵人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "咕......救命......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賞金獵人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "太慘了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "就像是被羅德島號來回碾壓過好幾遍......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "可、可斯卡蒂不是還沒進來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "這個看上去像炸開的洞是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "也就是說——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你已經想明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我哪裡演得不好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你果然是————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
